 hairstyle, hair color, eye color, body proportions, clothing design, footwear, accessories, and defining colors while translating her appearance into polished hand-drawn 2D cel animation. Only one instance of <Subject 1> appears in the target video.\n\n<Subject 2> is the male student defined by <Picture 2>. If the reference contains multiple views, they all depict the same person. Preserve his exact facial identity, mature facial structure, body proportions, predominantly black layered hair with one narrow white streak, subtle circular stud on his right ear, clothing design, footwear, accessories, and defining colors while translating his appearance into polished hand-drawn 2D cel animation. Only one instance of <Subject 2> appears in the target video.\n\nsummary:\n[reference generation] The target video is a 15-second, 16:9, 2K, hand-drawn 2D cel-animated romantic comedy featuring <Subject 1> and <Subject 2> on a text-generated coastal sidewalk at sunset. <Subject 1> shyly invites <Subject 2> to her empty home, but he interprets her statement that her parents have left as a request to perform a funeral vigil. His solemn refusal creates the narrative reversal, while <Subject 1>’s delayed realization and furious final response form the single emotional climax. At that climax, the warm coastal setting transforms into a high-contrast red-and-black manga impact background with aggressive ink lines, explosive speed lines, impact flashes, pressure waves, and increasingly strong frame shake. The reference pictures define only the character identities; the coastal environment, actions, camera coverage, effects, lighting, ambience, and music are generated from the written description.\n\nretention_analysis:\n<Subject 1> (appears in [Shot 1], [Shot 2], [Shot 3], [Shot 4], [Shot 5], [Shot 6]): fully_preserved - retain her exact identity, facial structure, hairstyle, colors, figure, clothing, footwear, and accessories from <Picture 1>, translated consistently into clean 2D cel animation. Her performance progresses visibly from nervous affection to hopeful anticipation, stunned disbelief, dawning comprehension, explosive embarrassment-driven anger, and exhausted helplessness.\n\n<Subject 2> (appears in [Shot 1], [Shot 2], [Shot 3], [Shot 5], [Shot 6]): fully_preserved - retain his exact identity, mature facial structure, black hair with one narrow white streak, subtle right-ear circular stud, figure, clothing, footwear, and accessories from <Picture 2>, translated consistently into clean 2D cel animation. Preserve his recognizable identity through relaxed walking, sudden shock, solemn concern, sincere refusal, startled recoil, and lingering confusion.\n\ndetailed_description:\n[Shot 1] Hand-drawn 2D cel animation with clean linework, flat color blocks, layered shadows, and expressive facial acting. A medium-wide side-tracking shot frames <Subject 1> and <Subject 2> walking beside each other along a text-generated coastal sidewalk at sunset. The low sun casts orange-gold light across the sea, while palm leaves, their hair, and their clothing move gently in the ocean breeze. <Subject 1> repeatedly glances toward <Subject 2>, looks away, and blushes. <Subject 2> walks casually while looking ahead.\n\n[Shot 2] At 00:02.400, <Subject 1> stops suddenly. <Subject 2> takes another half-step before turning back toward her. The camera cuts to a medium close-up of <Subject 1> and pushes in with small amplitude at slow speed. She lowers her head, clasps her hands nervously, draws her shoulders inward, and takes a quiet breath. The shy young woman with a soft, youthful, breathy Chinese voice (S1) looks up briefly and says with synchronized lip movement: <d>[Chinese] 晚上来我家吗？，我爸妈都走了。</d> Her cheeks deepen in color as she waits with a tense, hopeful smile.\n\n[Shot 3] At 00:05.800, the camera cuts to a frontal close-up of <Subject 2>. His pupils expand, his shoulders stiffen, and he recoils half a step with a shocked expression. A pale-blue hand-drawn impact flash crosses the frame. The warm coastal palette briefly changes to cold, desaturated blue-gray, and the camera pushes in with small amplitude at fast speed. His shock settles into grave concern. He raises one hand defensively, shakes his head with complete sincerity, and answers in a tense but apologetic low Chinese male voice (S2): <d>[Chinese] 姐！我是穷点，但是守灵这活，我真干不了啊</d> He finishes with a solemn nod, genuinely believing he has refused a funeral-vigil job.\n\n[Shot 4] At 00:09.500, the camera cuts to an extreme close-up of <Subject 1>. Her shy smile remains frozen while her eyes widen and her lips part. The camera holds completely still. A single strand of hair crosses her cheek in the sea breeze as she blinks once and gradually understands his interpretation. The warm colors drain from her face, the background simplifies into a pale empty field, and all visible motion pauses for one full beat.\n\n[Shot 5] At 00:10.500, <Subject 1>’s expression snaps from blank disbelief into furious embarrassment. Her eyebrows drive downward, her face turns bright red, an exaggerated vein mark appears at her temple, and both hands clench into fists. The camera zooms in with large amplitude at fast speed toward her eyes as a jagged white flash cuts across her pupils. The coastal background shatters into a high-saturation red-and-black manga impact field. Thick trembling ink lines, flame-shaped energy, radial speed lines, and drawn debris explode outward behind her. She stomps forward, throwing her hair and clothing backward in a circular pressure wave. The enraged young woman (S1) shouts in a Chinese voice that rises into a cracking scream: <d>[Chinese] 我他妈找茬都想不出来这种话！</d> The frame shakes increasingly strongly throughout the line. On “这种话,” the animation reaches its visual and emotional peak with the strongest shake, a full-frame white impact flash, a black ink-burst silhouette, and an expanding red pressure ring.\n\n[Shot 6] At 00:13.900, the shot cuts to a medium two-shot as every stylized effect disappears instantly and the warm coastal sunset returns. <Subject 1> pants while glaring at <Subject 2>, then closes her eyes, raises one hand to her forehead, and lets her shoulders collapse in exhausted disbelief. <Subject 2> leans backward from the outburst, slowly points toward himself, tilts his head, and remains completely confused. The camera pulls out with small amplitude at slow speed as a seagull crosses the sunset behind them, ending on their awkward silence.\n\noverall_soundscape:\nOcean waves, steady sea breeze, distant road traffic, light footsteps, moving fabric, palm leaves, and occasional seagulls establish the coastal street. A restrained heartbeat accelerates before <Subject 1>’s invitation, followed by a cold impact accent when <Subject 2> recoils. All ambience drops out during her realization; her outburst brings layered bass impacts, ink-tearing sounds, rushing pressure waves, escalating frame-shake hits, and a final explosive crack synchronized with the full-frame flash. Natural waves return immediately afterward beneath her panting, his confused inhale, and one distant seagull call.\n\nnon_diegetic_music:\nSoft celesta notes and light pizzicato strings play at a moderate tempo during the opening walk and gradually thin beneath <Subject 1>’s invitation. The score stops during <Subject 2>’s solemn refusal, followed by a sustained high string tone during her silent realization. Rapid ascending strings and heavy percussion enter with her anger, culminating in one orchestral impact on the final phrase before cutting to silence. A short questioning bassoon figure accompanies <Subject 2>’s confused gesture.",1344,768,124,"Ref2VA — 参考生音视频","native",1,false,0,true,"match","official_2_to_15s"]},{"id":42,"type":"AddLabel","pos":[4355.266359343909,2074.6501568838794],"size":[270,270],"flags":{},"order":16,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"image","name":"image","type":"IMAGE","link":57},{"localized_name":"caption","name":"capti